doctype html
html
  head
    meta(charset="UTF-8")
    title New Doula Join Enquiry
  body
    h2 New Doula Join Enquiry Received

    p A new doula has submitted a join enquiry for your region(s).

    ul
      li
        strong Name:
        |  #{name}
      li
        strong Email:
        |  #{email}
      if phone
        li
          strong Phone:
          |  #{phone}
    p Please log in to the admin panel to review and take action.
